hadiths[34]{hadithnumber,text}:
"965","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mulamasa aur munabadha se mana farmaya."
"966","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Do rozon aur do bai'on se mana kiya jata hai: Fitr aur Nahr se, aur mulamasa aur munabadha se."
"967","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne do libason aur do bai'on se mana farmaya: Bai mein mulamasa aur munabadha se mana farmaya. Aur mulamasa aadmi ka doosre ke kapde ko apne hath se raat ya din mein chhuna hai aur use is ke siwa na palate. Aur munabadha aadmi ka doosre ki taraf apna kapda phenkna aur doosre ka apna kapda phenkna hai, aur ye un ki bai ho baghair dekhe aur razaamandi ke. Aur do libas: Samma ka liptna. Aur samma ye hai ke apna kapda apne ek kandhe par rakhe aur us ka ek pehlu zahir ho jis par kapda na ho. Aur doosra libas apne kapde se guthhi lagana jabke wo baitha ho aur us ki sharmgah par us mein se kuchh na ho."
"968","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne habal al-habala ki bai se mana farmaya. Aur ye bai thi jo jahiliyat wale karte they. Aadmi oont khareedta ke oontni janegi, phir jo us ke pet mein hai wo janegi."
"969","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se ek apne bhai ki bai par bai na kare."
"970","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Sawaron se milne na jao, tum mein se ek apne bhai ki bai par bai na kare, najsh na karo, shehri dehati ke liye na beche, bakriyon ko na roke. Aur jo use khareede wo doodh nikalne ke baad do behtar nazaron mein hai: Agar pasand kare to roke, agar na-pasand kare to lautaye aur khajoor ka sa'."
"971","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne milne se mana farmaya, Muhajir ke dehati ke liye bechne se, aurat ke apni behan ki talaq ki shart lagane se, mard ke apne bhai ke bhao par bhao lagane se. Aur najsh aur tasriya se mana farmaya."
"972","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jo doodh roki hui bakri khareede aur use lautaye to us ke sath sa' lautaye. Aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne bai'on se milne se mana farmaya."
"973","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Sawaron se milne na jao, shehri dehati ke liye na beche [rawi ne kaha]: Phir main ne Ibn Abbas se kaha: Aap ke qaul ka kya matlab hai ke shehri dehati ke liye na beche? Unhon ne kaha: Wo us ka dalal na bane."
"974","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hamein mana kiya gaya ke shehri dehati ke liye beche."
"975","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Raha jis se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mana farmaya, wo khana hai ke use qabze se pehle becha jaye. Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Aur main har cheez ko is jaisa hi samajhta hun."
"976","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo khana khareede wo use na beche yahan tak ke poora le le."
"977","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Wo bazar ke upar khana khareedte aur use apni jagah bechte. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhe mana farmaya ke wo use apni jagah bechein yahan tak ke use muntaqil karein."
"978","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Bai karne wale dono mein se har ek ko apne sathi par ikhtiyar hai jab tak juda na hon, siwaye ikhtiyar ki bai ke."
"979","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jab do mard bai karein to un mein se har ek ko ikhtiyar hai jab tak juda na hon, jabke wo jama hon. Ya un mein se ek doosre ko ikhtiyar de. Phir unhon ne is par bai ki to bai wajib ho gayi. Aur agar wo bai ke baad juda hon aur un mein se ek ne bai na chhori to bai wajib ho gayi."
"980","[AI-translation] Hazrat Hakim bin Hizam (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Bechne wale dono ko ikhtiyar hai jab tak juda na hon, ya farmaya: Yahan tak ke juda hon. Phir agar wo sach bolein aur wazeh karein to un ki bai mein barkat di jayegi. Aur agar chhupayein aur jhoot bolein to un ki bai ki barkat mitayi jayegi."
"981","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se zikr kiya ke use bai'on mein dhoka diya jata hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Jab bai karo to kaho ke dhoka nahi."
"982","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah ne phalon ki bai se mana farmaya yahan tak ke un ki durusti zahir ho. Bechne wale aur khareedne wale dono ko mana farmaya."
"983","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne phal ke pakne se pehle bechne se mana farmaya. Aur us mein se kuchh deenar aur dirham ke siwa na becha jaye, siwaye araya ke."
"984","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne khajoor ke bechne se mana farmaya yahan tak ke khaya jaye ya khilaya jaye, aur yahan tak ke tola jaye. Un se kaha gaya: Tola jana kya hai? Un ke paas ek shakhs ne kaha: Yahan tak ke mehfooz kiya jaye."
"985","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Thabit (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ariya wale ko ijazat di ke use apne andaze par beche."
"986","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Abi Hathma (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne phal ko khajoor se bechne se mana farmaya. Aur ariya mein ijazat di ke use apne andaze par becha jaye, us ke ghar wale use tari khayein."
"987","[AI-translation] Hazrat Rafi bin Khadij aur Sahl bin Abi Hathma (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne muzabana se mana farmaya, phal ko khajoor se bechne se, siwaye araya walon ke, kyunke Aap ne unhe ijazat di."
"988","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne paanch wasaq ya paanch wasaq se kam mein araya ki bai ki ijazat di."
"989","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne muzabana se mana farmaya. Aur muzabana phal ko khajoor se nap kar bechna hai, kishmish ko angoor se nap kar bechna hai."
"990","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne muzabana se mana farmaya: Ke apne bagh ka phal beche, agar khajoor ho to khajoor se nap kar, agar angoor ho to use kishmish se nap kar beche, ya kheti ho to use khane ke nap se beche. Aur is sab se mana farmaya."
"991","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo khajoor beche jab us ki pevandkari ho chuki to us ka phal bechne wale ka hai, magar khareedne wala shart lagaye."
"992","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mukhabara, muhaqala, muzabana se mana farmaya, phal ke us ki durusti zahir hone se pehle bechne se, aur ye ke wo deenar aur dirham ke siwa na becha jaye, siwaye araya ke."
"993","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum mein se mardon ke paas zameen ki fazilat thi. Phir unhon ne kaha: Hum use tihayi, chauthayi aur aadhe par kiraye par denge. To Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jis ke paas zameen ho wo use boye ya apne bhai ko de. Phir agar inkar kare to apni zameen roke."
"994","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jis ke paas zameen ho wo use boye ya apne bhai ko de. Phir agar inkar kare to apni zameen roke."
"995","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne muzabana aur muhaqala se mana farmaya. Aur muzabana khajoor ke darakhton par phal ko khajoor se khareedna hai."
"996","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar aur Rafi bin Khadij se Nafi ke hawale se riwayat hai ke Ibn Umar Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam), Abu Bakr, Umar, Usman aur Muawiya ki khilafat ke shuru ke zamane mein apni khetiyan kiraye par dete. Phir unhe Rafi bin Khadij se khabar di gayi ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne khetiyon ke kiraye se mana farmaya hai. Phir Ibn Umar Rafi ke paas gaye aur main un ke sath gaya. Phir unhon ne un se poochha. To unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne khetiyon ke kiraye se mana farmaya hai. Phir Ibn Umar ne kaha: Main janta hun ke hum Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke zamane mein apni khetiyan us par kiraye par dete they jo mendon par ho aur bhoose mein se kuchh par."
"997","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zuhair bin Rafi (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein us mamle se mana farmaya jo hamare liye narmi tha [Rafi bin Khadij ne kaha, is hadith ke rawi]: Main ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne jo farmaya wo haq hai. Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujhe bulaya. Aap ne farmaya: Tum apni khetiyon se kya karte ho? Main ne kaha: Hum use chauthayi aur khajoor aur jau ke wasaqon par kiraye par dete hain. Aap ne farmaya: Aisa na karo. Use boyo ya buwayo ya roko. Rafi ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Sunna aur itaat."
"998","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us se [matlab mukhabara se] mana nahi farmaya. Lekin farmaya: Tum mein se ek ka apne bhai ko dena us ke liye behtar hai ke us se maloom lagan le."
